      <h1 class="pbs-h1">Pear Body Shape</h1>
      <p class="pbs-subtitle">Hips visibly wider than the bust, with a waist that's present but not sharply carved — the second most common of the seven female body shapes, at roughly 20% of women. Here's the exact formula, how it differs from its closest cousin, and how to dress for it.</p>
    </header>
  </div>

